  "Pip Plans a Play\n\nPip plans a puppet play for a sunny day. Pip makes a small stage from a tray. The tray tips to one side on the grass. Pip puts the tray on a low, flat box. Now the stage can stay still. Pip puts the puppets on the stage. The play can begin.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/9f59fdd8c79eba5d5d4e.mp3",
