  "Pip and the Night Light\n\nPip drops a key in the grass at night. Pip takes a bright light outside to find the key. Pip holds the light high but cannot see the key. Pip moves the light close to the ground. Now Pip sees the key beside a stone. Pip picks up the key and goes inside.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/6460918401f6bbef37ce.mp3",
