  "Chips Opens the Chest\n\nChips keeps dress-up clothes in a chest. Chips wants a scarf for a puppet. The chest will not open. Chips checks the front and lifts the little latch. Now the lid opens. Chips finds a scarf under a hat. Chips wraps the scarf around the puppet.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/97519793b9795c822682.mp3",
