  "Chips Tries the Stew\n\nChips sat at the table with a bowl of stew. Steam rose from the bowl. Chips blew on a small spoonful. The stew was still too hot to eat. Chips waited and stirred it slowly. Later, Chips tried another spoonful. This time, the stew was cool enough.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/78ae01cb3de3a34fbd6f.mp3",
