  "Chips Finds a Raincoat\n\nRain falls while Chips waits by the door. Chips gets a raincoat from a hook. The coat has sleeves that cover both hands. It is too big. Chips hangs it back and takes a smaller coat. This coat fits. Chips puts on boots and walks outside to meet Pip.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/40e3bbb08079001732a4.mp3",
