  "Chips Gets Ready for a Day Trip\n\nChips packs for a day trip. A water bottle, an apple and a map sit on a tray. Chips puts the bottle and apple in a bag. Chips wants the map in a small pocket. The open map is too wide. Chips folds the map and puts it in the pocket. Then Chips puts the tray away.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/a7ac6b01e638fa687a48.mp3",
