  "Chompy Brushes Teeth\n\nChompy squeezes toothpaste onto a brush. Chompy brushes the front teeth, then the back teeth. In the mirror, Chompy sees foam around the mouth. Chompy spits the foam into the sink and rinses the brush. The brush goes in a cup. Chompy wipes the mouth with a clean towel.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/5124bcde0e2e79676746.mp3",
