  "Chompy Shares a Peach\n\nChompy washes a peach for a snack. Chompy asks Muddy to cut it around the hard stone. Muddy puts the slices on a plate. Chompy gives Muddy and Pip two slices each. Chompy eats the last slice. The stone goes in the food bin. Muddy washes the knife and plate.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/9d18bb77ac53d78c28c2.mp3",
