  "Muddy Makes Marks\n\nMuddy puts wet sand in a flat pan. Muddy presses one hoof into the sand. A hoof mark stays in the sand. Muddy adds a leaf beside the mark and presses again. The leaf makes a different mark. Muddy shows both marks to Pip.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/95b1a9f678338ee63835.mp3",
