  "Socks Rolls the Rug\n\nSocks wants to clean under a rug. Socks rolls the rug up from one end. Dust and a lost button are under it. Socks puts the button in a small cup. Then Socks sweeps up the dust. Socks opens the rolled rug on the clean floor.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/ab53c77a668617d299bd.mp3",
