  "Chips Draws the Route\n\nChips draws a map to the library. Chips adds the park and the bakery. A line joins the house to the park. Another line goes from the park to the library. Chips folds the map and puts it in a bag. Chips can use it to find the way back.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/7c6a973b3e60869f82f5.mp3",
