  "Chompy Makes a Toy Bed\n\nChompy gets a red box for a toy bed. A toy bear fits inside the box. Chompy folds a soft cloth to make a pillow. The bear’s head rests on the pillow. Chompy pulls a small blanket over the bear. The bear’s face stays out of the blanket.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/faae15a7f564632ed164.mp3",
