  "Pip Hops on the Spots\n\nPip draws spots on the ground with chalk. Each spot is one small hop from the next. Pip can hop from spot to spot. Socks wants a turn too. Pip adds a spot near the start for Socks. Socks can stop there before the longer hop.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/fd20a85200f3760cc2ef.mp3",
