  "Fluff Finds a Mug\n\nFluff sees a mug on the picnic table. A name is written under the mug. Fluff lifts it up and reads the name. It says Socks. Fluff finds Socks by the gate. Socks takes the mug and gives Fluff a wave. Fluff goes back for a cup of water.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/5b47dffa705dacd68011.mp3",
