  "Chips Fixes the Wobble\n\nA small table moves when Chips leans on it. One leg is shorter than the others. Chips gets a folded piece of card. Chips slips the card under the short leg. Now all four legs rest on something. Chips can set a cup on the table without a wobble.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/fef61e56f38abdc2df45.mp3",
