  "Chompy Makes Two Prints\n\nChompy has a pink ink pad and a blue ink pad. Chompy presses a big stamp on the pink pad. The stamp makes a pink flower on paper. Chompy cleans the stamp with a damp cloth. Then Chompy uses the blue pad. A blue flower appears beside the pink one.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/06e92a6ba58edc7cc255.mp3",
