  "Muddy Draws on the Window\n\nMuddy rides a bus on a cold day. The bus is warm inside. A patch of fog covers the window near Muddy. Muddy draws a circle in it with one hoof. The clear circle shows a tree outside. Later, the fog covers the circle again.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/70d9eecfa139e062fc31.mp3",
