  "Pip Counts the Shells\n\nPip finds empty nut shells under a tree. Pip puts one shell in each small cup. There are five cups but only four shells. Pip looks under the fallen leaves. One more shell is there. Pip picks it up and fills the last cup.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/cd9771a67c13b2514126.mp3",
