  "Socks Makes a Shadow\n\nSocks stands beside a wall in the sunshine. A shadow falls on the wall. Socks lifts one arm and watches the shadow change. Pip holds up a leaf beside Socks. The leaf makes a small shadow with a different shape. Socks shows Pip the two shadows.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/2817880e6b6120d8cd50.mp3",
