  "Chompy Stirs the Soup\n\nChompy stirs thick soup with a spoon. The soup is hard to pour. Muddy adds a little warm water. Chompy stirs again. Now the soup is thin enough to pour into bowls. They fill both bowls and leave the soup to cool before eating.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/93f807a7038c5620b52c.mp3",
