  "Pip Checks the Pots\n\nPip has three plants on a windowsill. The first two pots feel damp. The soil in the third pot is dry. Pip gives water only to the third plant. Some water runs into its tray. Pip empties the tray and puts the pot back with the others.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/0304910dff1153ba35aa.mp3",
