  "Socks Measures the Path\n\nSocks uses a stick to measure a path. Socks starts at the gate. After each stick length, Socks draws a chalk mark. Six lengths reach the last stone by the tree. Pip measures with a shorter stick. Pip needs more stick lengths to reach the same stone.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/1d86703de015339d2e87.mp3",
