  "Chompy Follows the List\n\nChompy has a picture list for tidying the room. The first picture shows books on a shelf. Chompy puts the books away and checks the list. Next come the blocks, then the toy cars. The last picture shows a clear floor. Chompy looks around and puts the list away.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/1e538535b998cc66e2d1.mp3",
