  "Muddy Opens the Tent\n\nMuddy opens the front flap of a tent. A little gust blows the flap shut again. Muddy rolls the flap up from the bottom. Two straps hold the roll above the opening. Now Pip can stand in the doorway without holding the flap. Fresh air comes into the tent.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/08eda63b6610b977400e.mp3",
