  "Fluff Tries a Cup Phone\n\nFluff makes a phone with two cups and a long string. Pip takes one cup across the room. Fluff pulls the string straight and speaks into the other cup. Pip hears the words through the cup. Then they let the string hang loose. The words no longer travel clearly along the string.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/eeba230e8006eae46d0d.mp3",
