  "Socks Makes Paper Rings\n\nSocks folds a pink paper strip into a ring. A little glue holds the ends together. Socks puts a blue strip through the pink ring. The blue ends join to make another ring. More rings make a long paper chain. Socks hangs the chain above the reading corner.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/03ad6b9295ced0077dfc.mp3",
