  "Chips Packs the Snacks\n\nChips packs a snack for each friend. Each paper bag gets an apple and two crackers. Chips checks the bags before the picnic. One bag has an apple but no crackers. Chips adds the missing crackers and closes every bag. Each friend can now take the same snack.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/ed6cba04fee5c3b508be.mp3",
