  "Muddy Builds a Clock Stand\n\nMuddy puts a small clock on a table. A tall book hides the clock from Pip. Muddy stacks two blocks at the back of the table. The clock goes on top of the blocks. Now Pip can see it above the book. Muddy checks that the clock stand is steady.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/dc8d27c8d1e68ab6bd93.mp3",
