  "So Pip can read the book": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/5cf6c5b3f55ada3dbeb9.mp3",
  "Pip Covers the Plate\n\nPip puts grapes on a plate for a picnic. Ants walk towards the grapes. Pip puts a mesh cover over the plate. Air can go through the cover, but ants cannot. The grapes stay safe under the cover. Pip takes the plate to the picnic table.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/811edf398f5704a49779.mp3",
