  "Chips Makes Space for a Picture\n\nChips made a picture of a duck. The shelf has no space for it. A tall vase stands in the middle. Chips moves the vase to another shelf. Now there is a place for the picture. Chips puts the picture where everyone can see the duck.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/ba07b3f6e8adac787e27.mp3",
