  "Muddy Finds Shade\n\nMuddy takes lunch to the lake. The bench is in the hot sun. Muddy sees shade under a large tree. Muddy spreads a mat under the tree. The lunch bag goes on the mat. Muddy sits in the shade and eats beside the lake.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/d420b0577d0b359e8ffc.mp3",
