  "Socks Finds a Game Piece\n\nSocks opens a game on the table. One round piece is missing. Socks looks inside the game box. A round piece is stuck under the lid. It is the same shape as the other pieces. Socks takes it out and puts it on the board.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/a3cd632ae270a6330e49.mp3",
