  "Chompy Moves the Plate\n\nChompy puts a plate of crackers on a table. The plate is very close to the edge. Chompy reaches for a cracker, and the plate starts to tip. An adult holds the plate before it falls. Chompy moves it to a place in the middle. Now the plate is safe, with space around it.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/78c4dc0e038dfa337961.mp3",
