  "Pip Uses a Small Lamp\n\nPip wants to make a paper lantern. Pip cuts shapes in paper and folds it. An adult brings a small lamp with a battery. It has no hot flame. Pip puts the safe lamp inside the lantern. They take the lantern outside to see the shapes shine.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/ec66e4d074bf56b4158c.mp3",
