  "Chips Measures a Ribbon\n\nChips needs a ribbon for a gift. A short ribbon cannot go around the box. Chips puts a long ribbon beside a ruler. Chips cuts it at the line marked five. This ribbon is the right size. Chips ties it around the box with a bow.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/f5a79734a7f9357eb4ae.mp3",
