  "Muddy Makes Ice\n\nMuddy fills a tray with water. Muddy puts the tray inside the freezer. After some time, the water becomes ice. Muddy bends the tray, but one piece stays inside. Warm water runs over the bottom of the tray. The last piece of ice comes out.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/2d8438a2f6afb8f6ad29.mp3",
  "What does Muddy put in the freezer?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/ba943983c6cfa6ceedbd.mp3",
