  "Socks Packs the Bike Basket\n\nSocks puts books in a basket on the bike. All the books lean to one side. The basket tilts as Socks holds the bike still. Socks moves some books to the other side. Now the basket is level. Socks can ride with the books held safely inside.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/66a3dba42ec27aeae186.mp3",
