  "Chompy Makes a Reading Tent\n\nChompy hangs a sheet over two chairs. There is a wide space inside for reading. Chompy puts a cushion and a book on the floor. It is too dark to see the words. Chompy lifts one side of the sheet. Now light comes in for reading time.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/b97e6a6bbf16b4f9d186.mp3",
