  "Pip Sorts the Socks\n\nPip finds five socks inside a washing basket. Two have a red stripe. Two have a blue stripe. One is plain white. Pip puts the matching socks in pairs. The white sock has no partner. Pip finds its partner still hanging on the washing line.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/f4fb5b08f4b0b95e88c8.mp3",
