  "Socks Makes a Box Handle\n\nSocks wants to carry a box home. The box has no handle. An adult makes a hole in each side. Socks threads a rope through the holes and ties knots. The knots stop the rope from slipping out. Socks lifts the box by the new rope handle.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/8598d88ea3ebaeff5a43.mp3",
