  "To hide the holes": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/398b46bb08b42e1233af.mp3",
  "Pip Turns the Plant Pot\n\nPip brings a small rose plant home. Pip puts it close to the window. After a week, the stem leans towards the light. Pip turns the pot so the stem faces the room. New leaves grow towards the window again. Pip turns the pot a little each week.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/0be6b48ae5e87addc45c.mp3",
  "What plant does Pip bring home?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/9e669dfa8e705b1a9ee5.mp3",
