  "Chompy Delivers a Note\n\nChompy has a note for a friend. The friend is not at home. Chompy sees a letter box close to the door. Chompy folds the note and puts it through the slot. The note lands inside the box. Chompy leaves before the rain begins.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/f6f15ebd87babc24aec9.mp3",
