  "Chips Puts the Hose Away\n\nChips finds a hose across the garden path. A friend will walk along the path soon. Chips moves a stone away from the hose. Then Chips rolls the hose into a circle by the wall. The path is clear. Chips waves as the friend walks safely home.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/9daa53062821e8d6c945.mp3",
  "What lies across the path?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/5b359896f5d6e3640469.mp3",
