  "To make the path wet": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/3c6d76cdf042c6c4dfc6.mp3",
  "Muddy Looks Through a Tube\n\nMuddy has a cardboard tube. Muddy wants to use it to look at a toy. One end has paper stuck over it. Muddy peels the paper off the end. Now both ends are open. Muddy looks through the tube and sees the toy on the shelf.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/f1c597a392852976c477.mp3",
  "What is the tube made from?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/225a5f5358e5305436ef.mp3",
