  "Socks Gives the Flute a Rest\n\nSocks plays a short tune on a flute. A friend starts to tell a story. Socks stops playing so everyone can hear the friend. The flute rests on a cloth. When the story ends, the friend asks for music. Socks can use the flute to play again.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/c2a2be07ab0c021005ed.mp3",
