  "Fluff Chooses Two Shelves\n\nFluff wants these two shelves for toy animals. One shelf is high and one is low. Fluff puts a tall giraffe on the low shelf. There is room above it for the long neck. Small toy ducks fit on the high shelf. These animals all have a place now.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/cb5ab8120f0c6d17d837.mp3",
  "What does Fluff put on the shelves?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/b29dfd026221fcbebf44.mp3",
