  "Muddy Builds a Train Bridge\n\nMuddy builds a track for a toy train. The two ends of the rail have a gap. Muddy lays a flat board across the gap. Two blocks hold up the board. The train rolls over the board without falling. Muddy claps and sends the train around again.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/625cfecde90ffcf2aa82.mp3",
