  "Up the tree": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/f03ced3acc65da8f380f.mp3",
  "Socks Offers a Seat\n\nSocks sits by a window on the train. A friend gets on with a heavy bag. All the seats are full. Socks stands up and offers the seat. The friend puts the bag down and sits. Socks holds the rail to stay steady while they wait to arrive.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/886e941ab5dccf3d332e.mp3",
