  "Chips Paints a Chair\n\nChips puts paper under an old chair. An adult helps Chips paint the chair blue. The chair needs time to dry. Dark clouds bring rain towards the garden. They move the chair under the porch roof. Chips can wait there without the paint getting wet.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/4418f4bf3e15f5ffd5ee.mp3",
