  "Pip Makes a Clay Bowl\n\nPip rolls a lump of clay into a ball. Pip presses a thumb into the middle. The sides are too low to hold many beads. Pip adds more clay around the edge. Now the sides are higher. Pip leaves the bowl on a tray to dry.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/84962c0446b4381d4be1.mp3",
