  "In a cupboard": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/33bdd96f3d0964aa6e8c.mp3",
  "Muddy Carries the Cups\n\nMuddy puts three empty cups on a tray. Muddy lifts the tray with one hoof. The cups slide towards one edge. Muddy sets the tray down before a cup falls. This time, Muddy uses both front hooves to hold it flat. The cups reach the table without sliding away.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/860f7069ca88da37f05f.mp3",
  "How many cups are on the tray?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/662b02cfa1ee8a8f2b79.mp3",
  "What happens when Muddy uses one hoof?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/ca66c4e815b95fe87252.mp3",
  "The cups slide towards one edge": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/22b26375a06c0fe1f84b.mp3",
