  "Holds it above the head": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/10406d294cfe6d1efe24.mp3",
  "Puts one cup underneath": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/b8f00d93433407543ce3.mp3",
  "Carries it by one corner": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/f014cb7ca8322f5089db.mp3",
  "Socks Changes the Play Space\n\nIt is a rainy day. Socks wants to play with a ball. The grass outside is too slippery for running. Socks puts the ball away and brings out a puzzle. Friends stay inside and help with the puzzle. They can play with the ball when the grass is dry.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/071c0516a96bb70a2b7b.mp3",
  "Why is the grass unsafe for running?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/f5412981f703f3ac75b2.mp3",
  "It is too slippery": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/a6015c17cf24c5595513.mp3",
