  "Before putting the puzzle away": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/c70e7fff56b0bd7f32b9.mp3",
  "Chips Keeps the Clay Soft\n\nChips makes a clay animal on a tray. It is time to leave for the day. The clay will dry if Chips leaves it uncovered. Chips lays a damp cloth over the animal. The cloth keeps the clay soft overnight. Next morning, Chips can add the ears.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/53de920e333a44f7a5f9.mp3",
  "What is Chips making?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/12c2c02018038e5f089f.mp3",
