  "To change its colour": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/548b503734edde190ea7.mp3",
  "Chompy Folds a Sheet\n\nChompy spreads a clean sheet on the floor. The sheet is longer than three small mats. Chompy steps back so both feet are off it. A friend holds two corners while Chompy holds the others. They bring the corners together. The folded sheet fits neatly on the shelf.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/84bb77aa2bcfc70bf336.mp3",
  "Where does Chompy spread the sheet?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/56b71880e58b079b2d35.mp3",
  "What does the friend hold?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/227110ec356cfb0a76ad.mp3",
  "Two corners": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/9042429f171c8f4ee2d0.mp3",
  "One mat": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/e7b9ca93ded69e2dc1ed.mp3",
  "Where does the folded sheet fit?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/bb460f1a0435bd781b3c.mp3",
  "Muddy Watches a Bee\n\nMuddy sees a bee on a flower. Muddy wants to see it up close. An adult asks Muddy to watch from beside a tree. The bee moves to another flower. Muddy can see it without touching it. Soon the bee flies away, and Muddy waves goodbye.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/79fdf819544bc0929c97.mp3",
  "What is the bee on at first?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/9952fd7ec62536d2eabd.mp3",
  "A fence": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/5dc7c9a04129f9d59987.mp3",
  "A rock": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/e151f23bfaf4cd85294c.mp3",
  "Where does the adult ask Muddy to stand?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/2cb3eb8e231e2b208a21.mp3",
  "Inside a shed": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/c0af62821eedc0e970fd.mp3",
  "How does Muddy watch the bee safely?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/c898deb812983fccacb0.mp3",
  "Without touching it": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/eaa053ba7a9c7fc98109.mp3",
