  "By putting it in a cup": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/f8b8d658c5de9ede456d.mp3",
  "By chasing it": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/a009f5bf769f0ca77ab9.mp3",
  "Pip Sorts the Green Beads\n\nPip tips a bag of beads onto a mat. Three green beads roll under a low chair. Pip sees them but cannot reach with one hand. Pip slides a tray under the chair. A soft brush rolls the beads onto the tray. Pip pulls the tray out and counts all three.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/e4c1365d5b0300acac3f.mp3",
  "How many beads roll under the chair?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/9c99c39278fbf754ec36.mp3",
  "What colour are those beads?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/bb85dcc1ca0dec7c190d.mp3",
  "What helps Pip bring the beads out?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/d2aef5cfc582c1ac2c94.mp3",
  "A tray and a brush": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/c24eca95be831dd41a50.mp3",
  "A cup and a spoon": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/90b72f424375a21a6a3c.mp3",
