  "A box and a cloth": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/e0eefc9c69cb84479808.mp3",
  "Fluff Sweeps the Doorway\n\nLeaves from a tree blow into the doorway. Fluff gets a small broom to sweep them outside. More leaves blow in through the open door. Fluff shuts the door before sweeping again. Now the leaves stay outside. The closed door keeps the floor clear. Fluff puts the broom away.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/a642e9a6e2ba91b54ea2.mp3",
  "What blows into the doorway?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/2a1ad9341304e500f422.mp3",
  "Paper cups": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/94a28167b57f96ba1472.mp3",
  "What does Fluff use to sweep?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/f61e26c33c35dda4e1a1.mp3",
  "A broom": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/3ed302f99b2d5aab8fed.mp3",
  "A mop": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/d1e7d03f762a7b2fadc6.mp3",
  "A shovel": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/303936d04b88cde0c0b6.mp3",
  "Why does Fluff shut the door?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/f79a33347c0a209df5c3.mp3",
  "To stop more leaves blowing in": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/a140c1bbd08a1b64dd1d.mp3",
  "To hide the broom": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/6a1095f817a98baa2447.mp3",
  "To warm the leaves": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/54247ad529d9ad2f7b4d.mp3",
  "To wash the doorway": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/d041456a443a1495928f.mp3",
  "Socks Finds the Meeting Tree\n\nSocks and Pip agree to meet by a tree. There are three trees near the playground. Socks points to the tree beside the red bench. Pip nods and goes to fetch a ball. Later, Socks waits beside that tree. Pip finds Socks there without searching the other trees.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/fb207d2b959423e48e91.mp3",
  "How many trees are near the playground?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/6c70c2a9e056fa640e12.mp3",
  "Which tree do they choose?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/145a3eecf8763ac3585b.mp3",
  "The one beside the red bench": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/4d83d57be0ce6afb4c00.mp3",
  "The one by the gate": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/241285351656d2d51f3a.mp3",
  "The one near the pond": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/6d6c37bbbfecf189905b.mp3",
  "The one behind the shed": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/6bb801e416b75b37f5c5.mp3",
  "Why can Pip find Socks easily?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/196d3993364c65126e3f.mp3",
  "They chose the same meeting place": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/2e4b7ebbbbe52d9c168f.mp3",
  "Socks climbs the tree": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/d82fc5d0ece5c8ed1755.mp3",
  "The other trees are gone": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/439930679672cadeea60.mp3",
  "Pip follows a trail of stones": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/7aefc06cc60dbccb37c8.mp3",
  "Chips Presses a Leaf\n\nChips finds a leaf under a tree. The leaf is damp, so Chips pats it with clean paper. Chips puts the leaf between two dry sheets. A heavy book goes on top. After several days, the leaf is flat and dry. Chips adds it to a book of leaves.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/32c0a5f9424cd35692bc.mp3",
  "What does Chips pat with clean paper?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/ac9f2285dd5e0246a980.mp3",
  "A damp leaf": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/90c6e27bf54d95b86d35.mp3",
