  "It becomes wet again": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/a33a2fd30e929370a10f.mp3",
  "Chompy Leaves the Shell\n\nChompy walks along the beach with an adult. They look at each shell on the sand. One shell moves when a little crab comes out. Chompy puts that shell back beside the sea. The crab walks towards a rock pool. Chompy draws it in a notebook instead of taking it home.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/da74403aec6ee437b653.mp3",
  "What comes out of one shell?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/1f06f57b23b630745b8f.mp3",
