  "Feeds it bread": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/c59a87151b7b28fc7840.mp3",
  "Muddy Finds a Peach Stone\n\nAn adult cuts a peach for Muddy to eat. A hard stone is in the middle. Muddy puts the stone on a clean plate. The soft peach goes into a bowl. Muddy eats the soft pieces with a spoon. The hard stone stays on the plate.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/7bd55cdc791cacb047f0.mp3",
  "What is in the middle of the peach?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/5b7c367346ac178818ea.mp3",
  "A hard stone": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/92e60183c371f501e32d.mp3",
