  "Fingers": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/08009ca77fc8d9cbb45e.mp3",
  "Pip Reads with a Friend\n\nPip and Socks read a picture book as a team. Pip holds the book so each reader can see. Socks points to a new word. They ask an adult to explain the word. Then they read the page again. Both readers can tell what happened on that page.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/3cc9c8317ba3af80b6bd.mp3",
  "Who reads with Pip?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/23dea0df3e7cad1c5d75.mp3",
