  "So the pages fall out": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/3b5fc98500de23b24781.mp3",
  "So the cover stays hidden": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/254ed42289747ab0cd7b.mp3",
  "What do they do after the adult explains the word?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/6b1ee700216a9823f992.mp3",
