  "Socks Checks a Coat Pocket\n\nSocks puts on a coat before crossing the road. The house key is not on its hook. Socks checks the deep pocket of the coat. The key is under a folded shopping bag. Socks takes it out and locks the door. Then Socks crosses at the crossing with an adult.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/6e89aede9304cd1ccc30.mp3",
