  "Behind a bus": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/c96e86d5f9fd7ee64d13.mp3",
  "Chips Helps the Small Plant\n\nChips puts a plant by a high window. The wall blocks the light from the small plant. Chips finds a low box and sets it under the pot. Now the leaves reach the light. Chips waters the soil and watches the plant grow. New leaves show after several days.": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/d0b4e806cef2e91659fc.mp3",
  "What blocks the light at first?": "/audio/production/en-US/comprehension/b26688ad76c6e725eadd.mp3",
